Drops the loop in engine.rs `decide` that reports each index write of a
revert, IndexChanged for a record put back and IndexRemoved for a pending add
removed, so revert again reports none of them, as before 61c51bb. That commit
is the fix: §11 says every write the engine makes is reported before the host
acts on it, and without the reports the persisted index keeps the pending
records the revert (§8.3) discarded.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_revert_reports_every_index_write
test: delocal-engine engine::tests::a_revert_reports_every_index_write_it_makes

